    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d587">

                <pb facs="0721" n="609" sameAs="frus:frus1935v03/pg609"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.515/681: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-07-29T15:00:00-04:00">July 29, 1935—3 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>224. The Department is reliably informed that T. V. Soong has cabled the Chinese
                    Ambassador at Moscow<anchor n="20" xml:id="d587-f1"/> to the effect that the
                    American Government, having promised to send a financial expert to China whose
                    mission and capacity would be similar to that of Leith-Ross and who is being
                    sent by the British Government, has failed to make the appointment. The American
                    Government has made no such promise. The British Government informed us of the
                    appointment of Leith-Ross and asked that the American Government likewise
                    appoint a financial expert to be attached to the American diplomatic mission in
                    China. The Department replied that the American Government would give
                    consideration to the matter. As yet no decision has been reached.</p>
                <pb facs="0722" n="610" xml:id="pg610"/>
                <p>The Department desires that you telegraph Atcheson or Cunningham to communicate
                    the substance of the foregoing orally to Soong.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
